{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1552.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"ef7427aab945014473d0e0e9051b95913c43687470b36e43ac5613194e41f69a","ja":"わぁっ！？　な、何事ですか！？\nま、まさか、停電っ！？","zh":"哇啊！？出、出什么事了！？\n难、难道说，停电了！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1552.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"fd288c82462854bf195aac511e84045084d45b1622647150694d19cfc7b50eae","ja":"ひゃっ！？　今度はまぶし……\nあれっ、ボードが増えてる……。","zh":"呀！？这次好刺……\n咦，板子变多了……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1552.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"2815113fe4b4c32557dd8cd9e6231642f8a79527ea59b10c59af5f9a22cf964b","ja":"ええ～っ！？　なんでこんなに、\nありさの写真があるんですか～っ！？","zh":"咦咦～！？为什么会有这么多\n亚利沙的照片啊～！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1552.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"b65c694622289977894c7eaa28042bef0cb340f0fcd79c19f4a62925208d44b7","ja":"ウフフ♪　暗闇に紛れて、\n写真ボードを追加したのよ！","zh":"呵呵♪ 我趁着夜色，\n偷偷加了拍照立牌哦！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1552.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"9793ffc3109fdda896f82fd0209d1c7420a24726bdefc209ccb513a63e81730c","ja":"亜利沙ちゃんが撮った写真だと、\n亜利沙ちゃん自身が写ってないでしょ。だから……。","zh":"要是亜利沙拍的照片，\n亜利沙自己就没拍进去了吧。所以……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1552.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"7f9e4d07e17bb2f1acc24714e19de9f63a37421a52e6f40cca812f6321ea2489","ja":"私達で亜利沙ちゃん専用ボードを作っちゃおうって、\nこっそり計画を立てたの。","zh":"我们偷偷策划了这件事，\n想亲手为亚利沙做个专用板。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1552.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"67bf6bca9f3422f92acc4b384bfb531d7d19fdf91c94972f3bdad2405669805f","ja":"ま、まさか、そのようなことを……！","zh":"难、难道说，竟然会有这种事……！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1552.unity3d","item_key":"commands[32].text","source_sha256":"631429a8f2e1ea3829b50e96ff21877e72eaebd1ca26af68b41d974d37ec831a","ja":"この写真は、カメラの電池がなくなりそうで、\n亜利沙さんが慌ててるところだよ！","zh":"这张照片拍的是亚利沙因为相机快没电了\n而手忙脚乱的样子哦！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1552.unity3d","item_key":"commands[33].text","source_sha256":"ba547d440251f4d1bb8b072e12a97170260cb4d2f881d266aa8fe3de3cd6b8ff","ja":"こっちは、亜利沙がレッスンで疲れた私達に、\n飲み物を配ってくれているところです。","zh":"这边是亚利沙在给因练习而疲惫的我们\n分发饮料时的场景。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1552.unity3d","item_key":"commands[34].text","source_sha256":"3e131abe26baea4dd679901231b3fb78faed85d819bd738978f7a96cde719093","ja":"これはリハーサル中に感激しすぎて泣いちゃったとこ！\n亜利沙さんって、ほんとにアイドルが大好きだよね♪","zh":"这是在排练时太感动而哭出来的一幕！\n亚利沙真的很喜欢偶像呢♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1552.unity3d","item_key":"commands[43].text","source_sha256":"203c2a2a9cf203bdb08f7707223dd6db53c9040716e9dd1013f07bbe3eeca59a","ja":"うぅ……ありさのためにここまでして\nくださるなんて……。","zh":"呜呜……您居然为亚利沙\n做到这个地步……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1552.unity3d","item_key":"commands[44].text","source_sha256":"fbd7e5879ec1c701d5f35e686310f6ffa6bbe186d163dfc816c27c1e1f62bfce","ja":"ありさ、大感激です～～っ！！","zh":"亚利沙太感动了～～！！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1552.unity3d","item_key":"commands[45].text","source_sha256":"058f2b98a9d39f6fbc3aaa44f5f4f72d247a8d73a03b6ca44b8b8ee7098ff74c","ja":"ちなみに、この素晴らしい写真を\n撮られた方々はどなたですか！？","zh":"顺便问一下，拍下这些\n精彩照片的人是谁呢！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1552.unity3d","item_key":"commands[46].text","source_sha256":"90bbea54a16a6b4ce6b97a944721316d7336c2b211c8a87786cfa24f79984879","ja":"ええと、こっちのが私で……\n他の写真も、一緒にいたみんなだよ。","zh":"嗯……这个是我……\n其他照片上的也都是当时在一起的大家哦。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1552.unity3d","item_key":"commands[47].text","source_sha256":"da11996cc7db2ad3b982e81839f08f5a77810130befa22aba790144cefd7e92e","ja":"ふおぉぉ～！　アイドルちゃんたちが、ありさを\n見つめて写真を撮ってくださったと……最高です～！","zh":"哇啊啊～！偶像们竟然看着亚利沙\n拍了照片……真是太棒了～！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1552.unity3d","item_key":"commands[48].text","source_sha256":"980425bf4a24863c6878e20031f6f9fa1c54ec046d150ed6e29b199da5f315a4","ja":"みなさんの愛がいっぱいつまったこの写真ボードは、\n子々孫々に受け継ぐ家宝にさせていただきますぅ～！","zh":"这块凝聚了大家满满爱意的照片板，\n我要当作传给子子孙孙的传家之宝～！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
